omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yX_8hmsHyn4Q7kNvwH-kLrJ&_nc_oc=Adok3r8utZR7l6vlTA1OL6W8h91QjI2VSZRZpw1Z8gQTGc37aMB4_W1RRYiWXLZroKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSwbKZ0__bHgnpxB19Fi50Vl0AW-rkBsKEyvO_ENgg_KQ&oe=6AF5D9B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EAVsJ9CypU8Q7kNvwH1t-zP&_nc_oc=AdqUiRE60il98JoIK6YHWmJB_MHhTbLyE4pawdvtHLid-iD6bvKGua8IKVzXhLcqmUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSiWImBnZQ1C9BzzZ6gkpCrhTuHDoaqhPUEOfXucrGQnw&oe=6AF5DB16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8V9EuWARfgcQ7kNvwF9mzWq&_nc_oc=AdoYi90c1Biwe5Xc_Ey_PeLGRyDAQeB3lFWYrB-SubsI50wY-5HpXI4lTCyjMhuPMbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYkVwZOVtmVjRWzdWg_j3GVBdA2B13CLzwaYEBVlq4ZA&oe=6AF5F037"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://